            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Mose guri báy, «Qoomoó alqoóm oo muruuwí tsuú' slaweek, moqonjoó xa'anoó ta bay natafi, nee oo xa'anoó ta bay shekeleti nee oo xa'anoó ta bay kelbena nee mooyángw tsuú'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mooyángw tsuú' tleehheek ar muruusíng adoodá' kur tlehhahhiiti nee mukdá' mooyaangw gu baál tlehhtuuwo, díwtií qaaseek as kahhó' kuwa hhohhó' nee as kuwa paraátl as aníng. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daqaní ku bahh xósl ay dír i natsatsauuti, kuri bahh qás dír geeraá sandakmooduú alqado baraá heémaadá' aníng nee kuúng ti dogagitaan. Daqaní mooyangwsíng dirhunge kwa ló'wa hhoohhooeés. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mooyángw adór kwí mukuwa tleéhh baloó ale, as kuungá' kuwa slikiinda', asma mooyaangwí masók kuungá' un tsahhá' tawa mooyángw taa hhoohhooeés as anuú AAKOÓ MUNGÚ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Heé mooyángw daa'awtí gwaa tleehh as slikiingós a baynitisa.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.38"
            ]
          }
